title: "Code and expected results for: Development and Research of Reliable Information Retrieval Methods for Kazakh-Language Question Answering Systems Based on External Knowledge Sources"
abstract: >-
  Seeded simulation (master seed 2026) that produces the expected values, tables
  and figures of the Results section of the article, together with the generated
  outputs. The values are expected values from a simulation, not measurements;
  the retrieval and generation pipeline will be added when the experiments are run.
